    "created_at": "2018-05-30T07:32:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-05-30T07:32:54Z",
    "body": "Before we merge this, I'd like @bzbarsky to weigh in why it's not prefixed in Firefox: https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/source/dom/webidl/HTMLInputElement.webidl.\r\n\r\nReading IDL, https://heycam.github.io/webidl/#prod-AttributeName suggests to me it can be either an identifier or `required` and therefore does not need to be `_required`.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "reactions": {
